  "finding": "no_work_count_omission_identified",
  "summary": "The CLI count controls repeated calls to the compiled GPU helper; the setup initializes and transfers the same CSR/value/vector inputs, and each helper launches the kernel over a ceil-divided grid. The final sm_86 SASS retains row bounds, CSR-controlled multiply-add work/backedges, warp reduction, and the row output store.",
